    "short_description": "DEKRA is the world's largest independent expert organization in testing, inspection, and certification, based in Stuttgart, Germany. Founded in 1925, DEKRA operates in over 60 countries with around 48,000 employees and generated €4.3 billion in revenue in 2024. The company focuses on public safety, offering services in automotive, industrial, digital, and personnel sectors.\n\nDEKRA provides a wide range of services, including vehicle inspections, industrial equipment testing, digital product certifications, and personnel audits. Their mission is to enhance safety and sustainability for people interacting with technology and the environment. As DEKRA approaches its 100th anniversary in 2025, it continues to emphasize its commitment to securing the future through its comprehensive services and solutions.",
